# Project: कौशल्य सेतू | Kaushal Setu (Maharashtra Skilling Outcomes & Impact Platform)

## Tech Stack
- Frontend: React 19, Vite, Tailwind CSS v4
- Charts & Icons: Recharts, Lucide React
- Code Quality: Oxlint

## Guidelines
- Always maintain clean UI design targeting government entity standards.
- Follow Tailwind CSS v4 utility standards.
- Check errors using the built-in terminal or oxlint if necessary.
- Modify existing components like App.jsx carefully without removing core application state.